    "text": "I labelled all 9 columns of job 1 and sent them to `report_profile`.\n\nTwo labels differ from the current contract. I marked `member_id` as PHI because it is a payer member identifier that links to a person outside the platform. The contract has it as non-PHI. I left `coverage_start` and `coverage_end` as non-PHI to match the contract, although they describe a person's coverage.\n\nThe file is quarantined, and the profile shows 8 rows break the `plan_code` rule because they contain `GOLD`, which the contract does not allow. That is for the contract owner to review; it did not change my labels.",
